+ ‘‘Ye ca rūpe pariññāya, arūpesu asaṇṭhitā \[susaṇṭhitā (sī. syā.
  pī.)\]; Nirodhe ye vimuccanti, te janā maccuhāyino''ti.
]

#block[
#set enum(numbering: "(1)", start: 15)
