1046.‘‘Kodha santusito loke, (iccāyasmā tissametteyyo) Kassa no santi
iñjitā; Ko ubhantamabhiññāya, majjhe mantā na lippati \[limpati (ka.)\];
Kaṃ brūsi mahāpurisoti, ko idha sibbinimaccagā''.

1047.‘‘Kāmesu brahmacariyavā, (metteyyāti bhagavā) Vītataṇho sadā sato;
Saṅkhāya nibbuto bhikkhu, tassa no santi iñjitā.

1048.‘‘So ubhantamabhiññāya, majjhe mantā na lippati; Taṃ brūmi
mahāpurisoti, so idha sibbinimaccagā''ti.

